(function(D){D.faqs=[{"c":"Services","q":"What does FODO actually do?","a":"We plan and run digital growth work: paid media, SEO, content, social, brand, websites, automation and measurement, connected by one Growth System so every activity has a reason and a measure."},{"c":"Services","q":"Do you produce videos and designs?","a":"We plan, script and brief. Design and video production are scoped separately with you or a partner; we never imply footage exists when it does not."},{"c":"Pricing","q":"How much does it cost?","a":"There is no fixed price list. Scope depends on channels, complexity, creative needs and goals. Ad spend is always paid by you, from your accounts. Request a custom growth plan and we will scope it with you."},{"c":"Pricing","q":"Is there a minimum ad budget?","a":"We advise a realistic minimum per channel during discovery based on your market; we will tell you honestly if a channel is not worth it at your budget."},{"c":"Process","q":"What is the FODO Growth System?","a":"Six stages: Discover, Diagnose, Strategize, Build, Launch, Optimize, that keep work accountable. See it on the About page."},{"c":"Process","q":"What do you need from us to start?","a":"Access to your analytics and ad accounts, a clear owner on your side, your goals, and honest answers in discovery."},{"c":"Ads","q":"Do you guarantee results from ads?","a":"No. We agree targets, test transparently and report honestly. Results depend on offer, market, budget and execution."},{"c":"Ads","q":"Who owns the ad accounts?","a":"You do. We work inside your accounts so data and history stay with you."},{"c":"SEO","q":"How long does SEO take?","a":"Typically months before meaningful movement. We show progress indicators along the way and never promise rankings."},{"c":"Websites","q":"Which website platform do you use?","a":"WordPress, Shopify, Webflow or custom builds, chosen for your content, commerce and team."},{"c":"Timelines","q":"How fast can we launch a campaign?","a":"Once tracking, creative and landing page are approved, launch can be quick. Typical timeline: 2–3 weeks from kickoff to first live campaign, agreed in your proposal."},{"c":"Reporting","q":"How do you report?","a":"A dashboard that answers specific questions plus a monthly written review of what moved, what we learned and what changes next."},{"c":"Contracts","q":"What are the contract terms?","a":"Most engagements start with a 3-month sprint and continue month-to-month with 30 days' notice. Payment terms are set out in your proposal."},{"c":"Growth Audit","q":"What is the Free Growth Audit?","a":"A human review of your website, SEO, paid media, social, content, conversion path and measurement, followed by a conversation about priorities. It is not an automated scan."},{"c":"Growth Audit","q":"Is it really free?","a":"Yes. It is how we understand whether we can help before anyone commits."},{"c":"Tools/Game","q":"Is the Growth Score a real audit?","a":"No. It is a self-assessment based on your answers, useful for reflection, not a substitute for a real audit."},{"c":"Tools/Game","q":"What do I get from the FODO Challenge?","a":"A score, explanations for every answer, and, if you score under 40, an invitation to a free 30-minute consultation. Higher scores unlock the Growth Playbook and a strategy-call option."}];})(window.FODO_DATA=window.FODO_DATA||{});
